  "headline": "RSPAD Submits Andi Amran And Sugiono Health Results To The MPR",
  "seoTitle": "Andi Amran And Sugiono Health Results Submitted To MPR",
  "metaDescription": "The RSPAD Gatot Soebroto hospital has delivered the medical examination results for vice presidential candidates Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono to the MPR.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "RSPAD Gatot Soebroto officials submitted the medical examination results of vice presidential candidates Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono to the MPR.",
    "The health assessment involved 14 testing stages and was conducted by a medical team composed of 25 specialist doctors.",
    "The MPR has scheduled the formal announcement of the health evaluation results for the candidates to take place during a plenary session on December 1."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Gatot Soebroto Army Central Hospital (RSPAD) has concluded a series of health evaluations for vice presidential candidates Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono. Following 14 distinct testing stages, the results were compiled and officially handed over to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) of the Republic of Indonesia on Thursday, November 26, 2026. According to reporting, the examination process was carried out by a medical team consisting of 25 specialists to ensure a comprehensive assessment of the candidates' fitness. While the physical delivery of these medical records to the MPR verification team has taken place, the specific findings remain confidential at this time. The MPR has confirmed that the final determination regarding the health check results for both candidates will be disclosed to the public during a formal plenary meeting scheduled for December 1, 2026.",
